			"date": "2024-05-13T16:55:20.869Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://hackers.town/@randomgeek\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>randomgeek</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://toot.cafe/@baldur\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>baldur</span></a></span> I think a lot about how full time sponsorship of 11ty almost killed the project</p>",
