			},
			"date": "2024-05-13T16:56:46.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://toot.cafe/@baldur\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>baldur</span></a></span> It's exciting! I was excited for you! It seems like such a great idea. And parts of it are.</p><p>But oh lord it's so dependent on the whims of people who don't really care.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112434996500825182",
			"parentId": "112434827812392632",
			"url": "https://wandering.shop/@betsythemuffin/112434996437462641",
			"author": {
				"name": "Betsy. (a muffin).",
				"url": "https://wandering.shop/@betsythemuffin",
				"avatarUrl": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/avatars/original/missing.png"
			},
			"date": "2024-05-13T17:38:13.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://hackers.town/@randomgeek\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>randomgeek</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://toot.cafe/@baldur\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>baldur</span></a></span> </p><p>Would love to hear more about this, if you've done any writing on the subject.</p><p>Before the xz crisis I naively assumed that monetary sponsorship was an easy solution to OSS sustainability, but I don't think money WOULD have helped that situation -- so I've been rethinking a lot, even though I do want to see folks get paid for labor.</p><p>Interested in hearing more practical perspectives.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
